  "scope": "Same-user local live-control availability and cleanup hardening,not privilege escalation or a separate same-user authorization boundary",
  "change": "Enforce fixed monotonic wire I/O budgets instead of renewing timeouts on each successful syscall. Server request read/response write and CLI request write:2seconds each; CLI response read:12seconds. Recompute remaining socket timeout before each operation and reject expiry after reads/writes. Keep handler wait up to10seconds separate. Peer checks remain before data transfer; LF/EOF framing and byte caps remain. CLI appends LF to the same request buffer before its bounded write.",
